  "description": "A comprehensive .NET library that extends LINQ to Objects with powerful statistical and data science features including distribution analysis (median, quartiles, percentiles, skewness, kurtosis), standard deviation, correlation, rolling windows, time-series analysis, linear algebra operations, and geospatial analysis (Haversine distance, radius filtering, nearest neighbor search, bounding boxes, route calculations).",
