  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.7.0: Added comprehensive Geospatial Extensions including Haversine distance calculations (km/miles), radius-based filtering, nearest neighbor search, geographic center/centroid, bounding boxes, route distance calculations, proximity clustering, and more. Perfect for location-based queries, delivery radius calculations, trip planning, and spatial analysis. Includes 23 new tests with full coverage.",
